config MQTT_INIT_PIGEON_ID
  string "Pigeon id this device connects to the broker as"
  default ""
  help
    The pigeon's own 64-character hex id, passed to pigeon_init() as
    pigeon_config.device_id. On this connector it is the CONNECT client id
    and username, and on a PSK build the handshake identity as well; the
    broker refuses a session whose three copies of it disagree. It is
    credential-shaped, so it belongs in the git-ignored prj.local.conf.

    The empty default fails at pigeon_mqtt_start() rather than connecting
    as nobody.

menu "Zephyr Kernel"
source "Kconfig.zephyr"
endmenu
